<%#
  The light / dark / system control.

  Rendered in two places, which is why it is a partial: the desktop top bar
  (#header) and the footer of the mobile drawer. Both render the same element
  with the same current value, so the two never disagree.

  `current` is resolved on the server, so the control is correct in the first
  paint. Locals:
    current  — "light", "dark" or "system"
%>
<laiss-cms-theme-toggle
  current="<%= local_assigns.fetch(:current, "system") %>"
  endpoint="<%= laiss_cms.admin_theme_path %>"
  label="<%= LaissCms.t("Colour theme") %>"></laiss-cms-theme-toggle>
